(1, 1, 'facility_discrepancy', 'swimming', '2026-27', 'The pool closed in June for resurfacing after a leak and reopens in November. Swimming lessons have moved to the municipal pool in the meantime, with transport provided. We should have told families sooner and are sorry we did not.', 14, '2026-09-28 09:52:37', '2026-09-28 09:52:37')
